---
import Profile from "../layouts/Profile.astro";
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
---

<Profile
  slug="spiritual-mentor"
  related={["speaker", "author", "apps"]}
  intro="I’m a Ritwik (ঋত্বিক). My spiritual work is rooted in my Living Ideal, Sree Sree Thakur Anukulchandra. Through Master Within, I share his teachings and help people find a place to begin their practice."
>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <h2>Where to begin</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        If the name Thakur is new to you, start with this short introduction to
        his life. It gives the context for the essays, gatherings and practices
        we share.
      </p>
      <a href="https://masterwithin.net/start/thakur/">
        Meet my Living Ideal ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <h2>Master Within Foundation</h2>
    <div>
      <figure class="field-photo">
        <Photo name="in-conversation" />
        <figcaption>In conversation at Master Within.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p>
        I co-founded Master Within Foundation in 2016. Education, daily practice
        and social service belong together in this work. Our Living Wisdom class
        is one way to join a conversation in Bengali and Hindi.
      </p>
      <a href="https://masterwithin.net/class/">
        Visit the Living Wisdom class ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="folio-row">
    <h2>Bijnan-Vibhuti</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        This is my project bringing Thakur’s philosophy into conversation with
        modern science. His vision of the Satsang Vishwa Vigyan Kendra also
        inspired our work through Vishwa Vigyan.
      </p>
      <a href="https://masterwithin.substack.com/p/rebuilding-vishwa-vigyan">
        Read “Rebuilding Vishwa Vigyan” ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Profile>
